oment the app was in To-Do tab (nav_todo). The To-Do tab might use a different \"search documents\" action. Hmm.\n\nLet me not overthink; the important question: is there a real bug in \"Search / Replace\" dialog? The extra \"2026-11-14 \" insertion is suspicious and reproducible twice in the todo.txt context. But is it a bug in the search/replace dialog or in toggle-done leftover? Let's isolate by reproducing in todo.txt from a fresh app state (reopen app) and without prior toggle-done, to see if the extra text appears.\n\nPlan:\n1. Restore Regex to cat@home (done).\n2. Go to files, reopen todo.txt (will it reload from disk \"（A) Pay rent\\n\"? Yes, saved state).\n3. Without doing toggle done, open search→REPLACE, replace \"Pay\"→\"Fee\", observe.\n\nBut how did I open \"Search documents\" in todo editor? Tap toolbar search while in To-Do tab. Let's reproduce.\n\nLet me go back to files and reopen todo.txt. Press BACK (hides keyboard), BACK (to files)."}
